OL,3,GNEWSAThe WW1 soldier given his name
OL,4,Aback after 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1915 Cpl George Thomas Manning of
OL,7,FIpswich was killed in World War One -
OL,8,Fbut it would take more than 100 years
OL,9,Fto find his body.
OL,11,FThe soldier from the Suffolk Regiment
OL,12,F2nd Battalion was killed fighting in
OL,13,FBelgium and his wife and two daughters
OL,14,Fdied never knowing where he was buried.
OL,16,FIn 2019 human remains were found in a
OL,17,Fditch near Ypres and confirmed to be
OL,18,Fhis. Alexia Clark, the Ministry of
OL,19,FDefence (MOD) detective who solved the
OL,20,Fmystery said: "It's always a nice
OL,21,Ffeeling to be able to give a man back
OL,22,Fhis name."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
