OL,3,GNEWSAThe WW1 soldier given his name
OL,4,Aback after 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith a full military funeral in Belgium
OL,7,Fnow planned, the MOD and the Ipswich
OL,8,FWar Memorial are searching for
OL,9,FManning's descendants so they might
OL,10,Fattend.
